or@example.com','Political analyst providing balanced commentary on current affairs. Dedicated to helping readers understand complex issues.','authors/9.jpg','published','2026-03-06 01:34:17','2026-03-06 01:34:17'),(10,'Amanda Brown','amanda.brown@example.com','Food and culture writer celebrating culinary traditions. Exploring the stories behind every dish and ingredient.','authors/10.jpg','published','2026-03-06 01:34:17','2026-03-06 01:34:17');
